DENSITY:	530.0  0  0  0
HEAT CAPACITY:	-33.6  4.182  0  0
CONDUCTIVITY:	0.145  0  0  0
TRANSPORT:	5e-7  0  0  0
EMISSIVITY & ABSORPTION:  0.81  1000

